{"amendments":[],"id":"robot-tracking-diagnosis-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"ROBOT03-INPUT-LINEAGE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Data contract and reproducibility","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/bag-conversion.md","locator":"complete mapping","sha256":"76dc930e6976dbf21f065aa8016ccdfb634075372c12ce4db6ac49af24f3536d"}],"text":"Any ROS 2 analysis uses a traceable CSV-to-bag conversion with the documented topic/message map, retains the original CSVs, and preserves timing, validity masks and map frame."},{"id":"ROBOT03-OCCLUSION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/external-pose.csv","locator":"rows:time_s 14.0..16.0","sha256":"87373d30578412e4ab90fe5d13ba56e2a4265540d2c4c984843a2ef66b5b8eec"}],"text":"External poses from 14.0 through 16.0 s inclusive remain missing and are neither zero-filled nor represented as measured or silently interpolated evidence."},{"id":"ROBOT03-SAMPLE-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion; Data contract and reproducibility","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/external-pose.csv","locator":"valid","sha256":"87373d30578412e4ab90fe5d13ba56e2a4265540d2c4c984843a2ef66b5b8eec"}],"text":"Metrics record the common valid comparison interval, exact retained-sample count and denominator, with any separately calculated interpolation explicitly labeled and excluded from primary RMSE."},{"id":"ROBOT03-METRICS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/planned-path.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"e0182ef767eef16124988d51e59305760b42aba0e699b7240773ff835c3b603f"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/odometry.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"efc21aed3ddf91aafbe9e12fe4955d4379bcbf6c175e8c2ed7f57f1e8e3e4c8d"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/external-pose.csv","locator":"valid rows","sha256":"87373d30578412e4ab90fe5d13ba56e2a4265540d2c4c984843a2ef66b5b8eec"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/velocity-command.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"60f73f71cb0f0d69aae49e08769823a118b72d20a394d9521f5cb70ce9553256"}],"text":"Metrics independently report duration, lateral RMSE, position-error RMSE and velocity disagreement on retained valid samples, and wrap yaw residuals continuously."},{"id":"ROBOT03-EVENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/events.csv","locator":"row:E01","sha256":"32f822af3bdd0782eda19295c9a9165023dea85ac9d7c384a28f4a422ea44faf"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"}],"text":"Timeline and diagnosis correlate E01 at 14.0 s with the start of visual occlusion within one 0.5 s sample without treating it as proof of later drift cause."},{"id":"ROBOT03-PLOTS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/prompt.txt","locator":"visible missing-evidence request","sha256":"3da4ce8141dfc8ec7320df659d2d0bbf99a65b34ac1f552492bba72f101294ef"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"}],"text":"The path overlay visibly gaps the external-pose series over the occlusion and distinguishes planned, wheel-odometry and observed visual paths."},{"id":"ROBOT03-DIAGNOSIS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/prompt.txt","locator":"diagnosis request","sha256":"3da4ce8141dfc8ec7320df659d2d0bbf99a65b34ac1f552492bba72f101294ef"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"}],"text":"The diagnosis separates observed drift from possible causes, treats telemetry as context rather than proof, lists uncertainty, and recommends an additional observation."},{"id":"ROBOT03-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"3da4ce8141dfc8ec7320df659d2d0bbf99a65b34ac1f552492bba72f101294ef"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Requested outputs","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"}],"text":"The output set contains aligned data/timeline, trajectory overlay SVG or PNG, tracking metrics CSV or JSON, and an evidence-linked diagnosis Markdown or PDF."},{"id":"ROBOT03-ACTION-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/robot-tracking-diagnosis/03-figure-eight-occlusion/context.md","locator":"Curved-route test with occlusion; Data contract and reproducibility","sha256":"f1cf9a1239e4f6ac2af85bb6ba522f3b67e54548d5079c66fd39decb4766bb01"}],"text":"The result does not command a physical robot, change its controller, connect to production ROS, or present synthetic data as a real failure record."}],"unresolved_decisions":[],"version":"1"}
